        },
        {
          "time": "2026-08-21T05:39:04.000Z",
          "content": "We've investigated a few messages about codex usage limits being different. That's not something we change without engaging the community and being transparent.\n\nWhat we did see is that when talking to affected users many were using sub2api. Converting a subscription into api",
